        "sid": "PHP 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha a, umego, anyong’a negwu i Rwoth. Goro iwu ma calku ma kwong’a, eola ngo, ento e ber iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubed ku weng’wu kum gwogi, wubed ku weng’wu kum jutic ma rac, wubed ku weng’wu kum ju ma thumo kum: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum wan wa weg yaa, ma warwo ku Tipo pa Mungu, e walula i Kristu Yesu, man wageno mwa kum ungo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nwang’u an nini e m’acopo geno cil i kum: tek ng’atu mange ie wacu ya egen kum, nwang’u an e m’asagu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 23:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jutimo yaa i kuma i ceng’ mir aborane, ma a nyakwar Israel, mi suru pa Benyamin, Jaebrania mi Juebrania; pi lembe mi cik, a Jafarisayo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 8:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pir ava tic ke, anyayu ragedo kum kanisa; pi bedopwe ma ni i cik ke, junwang’a ma lembe mbe i wia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento giki ma naka gi kuloka ira, maeni akwanugi ni gin m’uoi mananu kum Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo andha, man akwanu gin ceke ni gin m’uoi mananu kum bero mi ng’eyong’ec pa Kristu Yesu ma Rwoth para: gin ceke oi mananu ira pire, man akwanugi ni usabu kende, kara anwang’ Kristu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man junwang’a i ie, m’abedo ku bedopwe para an ungo, cil maeno ma mi cik, ento maeno ma en e mi yioyic pa Kristu re, bedopwe m’uai ba Mungu ni kum yioyic: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara ang’eye, ku tego mi cer m’ecer ko, ku ripocwiny mi sendri pare, m’abedo ko ni ayi tho pare; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tek acopo tundo kum cer ma kind ju m’utho ku yo moko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Calu m’adaru nwang’u ngo, kadi judaru dwoka ndhu cu de ngo: ento abecikucwala, tek kuno nyo acopo maku maeca ma Kristu Yesu bende maka ni kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umego, fodi akwandra gira ngo ya amaku: endre gin acel abetimo, ma wia wil kum gin ma ni i ng’eya, m’abecwala rut kum gin ma ni i wang’a de, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abecwala kara atund kakara kum sukulia mi lwong’o ma malu pa Mungu ni kum Kristu Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno, dong’ wan ma wang’wa teng’ni kum lembe, wabed ku pidoic ma kumeno: man ke tek wubedo ku pidoic ma tung’ i gin moko, e Mungu binyutho maeni bende iwu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mae kende, i maeni ma wadaru wok i ie, dong’ wawothu ku lembe ma calacel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
